ima Island's sacred shore\nWhere the famous Itsukushima Shrine doth float upon the waves once more\nWatch the sunset over the sea and the island's tranquil face\nAnd bid farewell to Japan's enchanting and mystic place", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -0.02102131024003029}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.01633308455348015}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.021408095955848694}, {"token": " see", "logprob": -0.08207069337368011}, {"token": "kest", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.3398338258266449}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.07988470792770386}, {"token": " most", "logprob": -1.6739238500595093}, {"token": " grand", "logprob": -0.05432267114520073}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.07302487641572952}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -0.40399837493896484}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.045519448816776276}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.02333860658109188}, {"token": " shores", "logprob": -0.40224650502204895}, {"token": " where", "logprob": -0.010420184582471848}, {"token": " rising", "logprob": -1.764275312423706}, {"token": " sun", "logprob": -2.3841860752327193e-07}, {"token": " do", "logprob": -2.6107174562639557e-05}, {"token": "th", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " stand", "logprob": -0.026148559525609016}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.005620269570499659}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -1.9050178527832031}, {"token": "in", "logprob": -1.126600980758667}, {"token": " lies", "logprob": -0.03217148035764694}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -0.04517235979437828}, {"token": " itinerary", "logprob": -0.009585758671164513}, {"token": " penned", "logprob": -2.8790059089660645}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -1.645146369934082}, {"token": " verse", "logprob": -0.009037680923938751}, {"token": " most", "logprob": -2.5008187294006348}, {"token": " fine", "logprob": -0.012349914759397507}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.13125374913215637}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -0.37574201822280884}, {"token": " guide", "logprob": -1.1920999895664863e-05}, {"toke